  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting conflict mitigation, conflict resolution and respect for IHL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support peace processes and conflict prevention initiatives at local, national, and international levels in Syria, Sudan, Sahel, through dialogue facilitation, mediation, empowerment of local actors, coordination support and analysis-sharing. It will also support humanitarian access and protection activities, as well as capacity building in Sudan and Central Sahel.</narrative>
  </description>
